  "instruction": "## Goal\n\nFix `MinidumpMemorySegment.search` and `MinidumpMemorySegment.asearch` so that when a memory segment contains multiple occurrences of a pattern, every match is reported at its correct virtual address. The search offset must accumulate across matches instead of resetting.\n\n## Observable behavior\n\n```python\n# Three matches with correct progressive addresses\nseg = MinidumpMemorySegment()\nseg.start_virtual_address = 0x1000\nseg.size = 0x100\nseg.start_file_address = 0x0\nseg.end_virtual_address = 0x1100\n\ndata = b\"A\" * 5 + b\"PAT\" + b\"B\" * 5 + b\"PAT\" + b\"C\" * 5 + b\"PAT\" + b\"D\" * 200\nfh = FakeFileHandler(data)\n\nresult = seg.search(b\"PAT\", fh)\nassert len(result) == 3\nassert result[0] == 0x1000 + 5\nassert result[1] == 0x1000 + 5 + 3 + 5\nassert result[2] == 0x1000 + 5 + 3 + 5 + 3 + 5\n```\n\n```python\n# Adjacent back-to-back patterns at correct addresses\nseg = MinidumpMemorySegment()\nseg.start_virtual_address = 0x3000\nseg.size = 0x100\nseg.start_file_address = 0x0\nseg.end_virtual_address = 0x3100\n\ndata = b\"A\" * 8 + b\"PAT\" * 3 + b\"B\" * 200\nfh = FakeFileHandler(data)\n\nresult = seg.search(b\"PAT\", fh)\nassert len(result) == 3\nassert result[0] == 0x3000 + 8\nassert result[1] == 0x3000 + 8 + 3\nassert result[2] == 0x3000 + 8 + 3 + 3\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Keep the public API of `MinidumpMemorySegment.search` and `MinidumpMemorySegment.asearch` unchanged.\n- Changes are limited to files in scope under `minidump/`.\n\n## How success is measured\n\nRun the verifier tests:\n\n```\npython -m pytest -q tests/generated/test_hist_6d779ab.py::TestSearchOffsetAccumulation::test_asearch_adjacent_patterns tests/generated/test_hist_6d779ab.py::TestSearchOffsetAccumulation::test_asearch_five_matches_progressive_addresses tests/generated/test_hist_6d779ab.py::TestSearchOffsetAccumulation::test_asearch_three_matches_correct_addresses tests/generated/test_hist_6d779ab.py::TestSearchOffsetAccumulation::test_search_adjacent_patterns tests/generated/test_hist_6d779ab.py::TestSearchOffsetAccumulation::test_search_five_matches_progressive_addresses tests/generated/test_hist_6d779ab.py::TestSearchOffsetAccumulation::test_search_three_matches_correct_addresses\n```",
